{"title":"45NRTH Rolls Out New Levitas Carbon Fat-Bike Rim in 27.5″ & 26″ Sizes","link":"https://bikerumor.com/45nrth-rolls-out-new-levitas-carbon-fat-bike-rim-in-27-5-26-sizes/","date":1789646400000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-airing-up.jpeg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" alt=\"(Photos / 45NRTH)\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/KZTjcxjz_8U?si=yUNAdGkQV0BduCpz\" target=\"_blank\">Winter is coming</a>. And nobody would know that more than our friends at 45NRTH. With winter comes the fat bike season (well, the bulk of the fat bike season anyway). So the Minnesota brand just launched some new carbon rims for fat-tire bikes. The new carbon Levitas fat-bike rims were designed to complement 45NRTH tires, but they’ll work with any fat bike tires in the proper size. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims first pic\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-first-pic-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a><figcaption>(Photos / 45NRTH)</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The internal widths of the new Levitas are tailored specifically for each wheel diameter. This creates a broad, well-supported tire profile that maximizes flotation, traction, and control for the most demanding winter conditions. The new Levitas uses a narrower spoke bed to reduce weight where possible, while still reinforcing the rim walls for strength and impact resistance. </p>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim.jpeg\"><img width=\"823\" height=\"823\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims rim\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim.jpeg 823w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim-297x297.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-rim-768x768.jpeg 768w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>45NRTH Levitas Rim Retail &amp; Detail</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Retail: $599 (one rim, and either 26″ &amp; 27.5″ size) </p>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754.jpeg\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1030\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims 275\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754-297x300.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754-120x120.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754-768x773.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-275-e1789496194754-895x900.jpeg 895w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646.jpeg\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"1010\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims 26\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646.jpeg 1024w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646-297x293.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646-120x118.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646-768x758.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-26-e1789496179646-912x900.jpeg 912w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>32-hole drill pattern for strong wheel builds</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Optimized relationship between tire volume and rim width for consistent contact patch and tire profile</li>\n\n\n\n<li>35mm rim depth</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Includes a single layer of 30mm rim tape and a 65mm valve </li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fits 4-5″ wide tires</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Max inflation: 30 psi</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tested to ASTM Category 3; suggested weight limit of 300 lbs</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims non drive lean\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-non-drive-lean-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims in the snow\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-in-the-snow-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n</figure>\n\n\n\n<h2>Levita Rim Specifications</h2>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>26″ Levitas Rim</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rim Size:</strong> 26″</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rim Material: </strong>Carbon </li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Spoke Count:</strong> 32</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>ERD: </strong>510 with washers</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Inner Rim Width:</strong> 84</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Outer Rim Width:</strong> 91</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rim Depth:</strong> 35</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Max PSI:</strong> 30</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Brake Type:</strong> Disc brake only</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Recommended Tire Range:</strong> 4-5″</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tire Type:</strong> Tubeless-ready</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 680g</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"854\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims cap\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-cap-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>27.5″ Levitas Rim</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rim Size:</strong> 27.5″</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rim Material: </strong>Carbon </li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Spoke Count:</strong> 32</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>ERD: </strong>536 with washers</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Inner Rim Width:</strong> 76</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Outer Rim Width:</strong> 83</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Rim Depth:</strong> 35</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Max PSI:</strong> 30</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Brake Type:</strong> Disc brake only</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Recommended Tire Range:</strong> 4-5″</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Tire Type:</strong> Tubeless-ready</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 660g</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean.jpeg\"><img width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean.jpeg\" alt=\"45NRTH New Carbon Levitas Rims lean\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean.jpeg 1280w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean-297x198.jpeg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean-120x80.jpeg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean-768x512.jpeg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean-800x533.jpeg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/45NRTH-New-Carbon-Levitas-Rims-lean-720x480.jpeg 720w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.45nrth.com/\" target=\"_blank\">45NRTH.com</a></em></p>","author":"Ron Frazelle","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/45nrth-rolls-out-new-levitas-carbon-fat-bike-rim-in-27-5-26-sizes/#comments","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"53a7e900eb8225c0f95af2098b50f4a0a35b619d3595a21fc8e7ba48524212d6","category":"Cycling"}